(In computer vision applications for medical diagnostics, relying on a single convolutional neural network \(CNN\) creates a critical single) Tj
T* (point of failure known as epistemic model vulnerability. Single architectures are prone to overfitting dataset-specific acquisition artifacts) Tj
T* (\(e.g., dermoscopic gel air bubbles, vignetting, patient hair, or biopsy markings\) rather than learning generalized biological lesion) Tj
T* (morphologies. To satisfy rigorous Computer Science and Machine Learning standards, DermXAI implements a Tri-Model Heterogeneous) Tj
T* (Ensemble that combines distinct inductive biases: Deep Residual Learning \(ResNet-50\), Compound Feature Scaling \(EfficientNet-B4\),) Tj
T* (and Dense Feature Reuse \(DenseNet-121\). This multi-model architecture achieves state-of-the-art diagnostic calibration, reducing) Tj
T* (individual network prediction variance while preserving high macro-average recall.) Tj
ET
