T* (For an ensemble of M distinct classifiers f_1\(x\), f_2\(x\), ..., f_M\(x\) each with variance sigma^2 and average pairwise prediction correlation) Tj
T* (rho, the variance of the ensemble mean f_bar\(x\) = \(1/M\) * sum\(f_i\(x\)\) is given by:) Tj
